; WS2812 (NeoPixel) LEDs: 800 kHz, one pin, colours from the TX FIFO.
; As the pico-sdk's example: pioasm ws2812.pio ws2812.pio.h
;
; The program and ws2812_program_init are pico-examples' pio/ws2812/ws2812.pio
; (https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-examples), changed for libpio: the
; comments, and init returns -1 when a call fails.
;
